---
import LegalLayout from '../components/layout/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site, emails, businessById } from '../data/site';

const realEstate = businessById('real-estate');
const commercial = businessById('commercial');

const toc = [
  { href: '#purpose', label: 'What this website is' },
  { href: '#relationships', label: 'Brand relationships' },
  { href: '#accuracy', label: 'Accuracy and change' },
  { href: '#destinations', label: 'External destinations' },
  { href: '#email', label: 'Email is not an agreement' },
  { href: '#ownership', label: 'Names, artwork and content' },
  { href: '#availability', label: 'Availability' },
  { href: '#contact', label: 'Contact' },
  { href: '#changes', label: 'Changes to these terms' },
];
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Website Terms | Obsidixz"
  description="The terms that apply to the Obsidixz parent website: its purpose, brand relationships, external business destinations and email contact."
  heading="Website Terms"
  lede="These terms apply to the Obsidixz parent website. They cover an informational site, not a sale — business services are agreed separately with the relevant business."
  updated={site.lastUpdated}
  toc={toc}
>
  <h2 id="purpose">What this website is</h2>
  <p>
    obsidixz.pp.ua is the website of the Obsidixz parent brand. It exists to explain what Obsidixz
    is, introduce its businesses, direct visitors to the right business or inbox, and provide a
    general contact route.
  </p>
  <p>
    Nothing on this website is an offer to sell a product or service. Obsidixz does not provide a
    service of its own through this site, and no purchase can be made here.
  </p>

  <h2 id="relationships">Brand relationships</h2>
  <p>
    Obsidixz is a parent brand. Obsidixz Real Estate, Obsidixz Commercial and Obsidixz Game Studio
    are businesses that carry the parent name. Word Quest is a product of Obsidixz Game Studio and
    keeps its own product identity.
  </p>
  <p>
    This description is about naming and identity. It does not establish registered subsidiaries,
    incorporation, a holding-company structure or financial ownership, and it does not make one
    business responsible for another business's work. Obsidixz is currently an unregistered business
    brand operated by {site.operator}.
  </p>
  <p>
    Services provided by a business — including its scope, price, timing and terms — are agreed
    separately and in writing with that business.
  </p>

  <h2 id="accuracy">Accuracy and change</h2>
  <p>
    The descriptions on this website reflect the organisation as it is at the date shown on the
    policy pages, and they deliberately state the limits of each business. The businesses are at
    different stages and will change; content may be updated, corrected or removed without notice.
  </p>
  <p>
    Business descriptions are summaries for orientation, not a substitute for the details published
    on a business's own website or agreed with it directly.
  </p>

  <h2 id="destinations">External destinations</h2>
  <p>
    This site links to business websites, among them
    <a href={realEstate.url} rel="noopener">{realEstate.url}</a> and
    <a href={commercial.url} rel="noopener">{commercial.url}</a>. Those sites are separate
    destinations with their own content and terms. Their availability, accuracy and practices are
    not controlled by this website.
  </p>
  <p>
    Some contact links open your own email application. That application is provided by a third
    party and its behaviour is outside this website's control.
  </p>
  <p>
    Obsidixz Commercial is currently served over plain HTTP while its HTTPS certificate is
    completed. Links to it are shown as HTTP for that reason.
  </p>

  <h2 id="email">Email is not an agreement</h2>
  <p>
    Sending an email to an Obsidixz address — or using a contact link on this site — does not create
    a contract, a project, a purchase or a payment authorisation. It does not reserve capacity or
    guarantee a reply within a particular time.
  </p>
  <p>
    No payment should be made on the basis of this website. Where a business quotes for work, the
    quotation is issued by that business with its own scope and terms.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ownership">Names, artwork and content</h2>
  <p>
    The Obsidixz name, the Interlock logo artwork and the text and photography on this website belong
    to the brand's owner. You may read, link to and quote briefly from this site with attribution,
    but it may not be republished as another organisation's own material or used to suggest an
    affiliation that does not exist.
  </p>

  <h2 id="availability">Availability</h2>
  <p>
    The site is served as a static website with no promised uptime. It may be unavailable during
    maintenance, hosting incidents or changes, and links may change as the businesses develop.
  </p>
  <p>
    Email is not a secure channel for sensitive information. Please do not send banking credentials,
    identity documents or passwords through it.
  </p>

  <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these terms or about this website:
    <a href={`mailto:${emails.general}`}>{emails.general}</a>. Business enquiries should go to the
    relevant business inbox listed on the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 id="changes">Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>
    These terms may be updated as the website or the organisation changes. The date at the top of
    this page shows the current version.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
